      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: what_is_he_hiding; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a satirical and accusatory narrative targeting Hillary Clinton, using her public image and political persona to imply she is hiding information, specifically referencing the 2016 email controversy. The text overlays suggest a conspiratorial tone, implying she deleted emails and destroyed devices to conceal wrongdoing. This meme is harmful because it promotes misinformation and conspiracy theories about a political figure, potentially damaging her reputation and contributing to political polarization. The meme does not contain overtly abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, or misogynistic content, but it does propagate harmful misinformation that can influence public opinion and undermine trust in political processes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_13ba4a8e"
      },
